> Datamunge

\image(assets/datamunge.png)
\alttext(Datamunge logo)
\color(Warning! This repo is under construction. The API is not stable and may change
without notice. Use at your own risk.)

Datamunge is a library for those who go rummaging around in the datas. It
provides datastructures and algorithms for manipulating and analyzing data and
provides bindings from it's C++ api to a large collection of languages. It's a
one-stop shop for data munging, providing everything you need from dataframes to
machine learning. It is designed to be fast, efficient, and easy to use.

